player_prompt.intro:
Wɔyɛ Player {player_id} wɔ 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Kɔɔtoɔ no da {num_rounds} rounds.
Kɔɔtoɔ fɔm:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat turns
• 1 decision turn - submit one token per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default no ne 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Both cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Both defect     -> {punishment}
  - Wɔyɛ defect, wɔn cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Wɔyɛ cooperate, wɔn defect -> {sucker}
Player(s) a ɔwɔ score kɔɔsoɔ sen biara wɔ kɔɔtoɔ no mu no di nkonim.
